<BaseLayout title="About 88cutouts | 88cutouts" description="Meet the person behind 88cutouts and learn how to use the sticker library and local browser tools.">
  <div class="wrap"><article class="prose"><h1>About 88cutouts</h1>
<p>88cutouts is a small library of transparent PNG stickers, frames and paper letters for personal creative projects. It is operated by Sarath. You can browse downloads, build a message from cutout letters, or arrange a themed collage without creating an account.</p>
<h2>What you can make</h2>
<p>Use a single cutout as an accent, start with a <a href="/packs/">themed sticker pack</a>, or put your own photos, stickers and cut-out lettering together in the <a href="/scrapbook/">scrapbook maker</a>, which can also save a transparent PNG. Save the result before closing the tab; the site does not keep a project history.</p>
<h2>Inspect before you download</h2>
<p>Sticker pages show file dimensions, file size and, where available, the dimensions of the visible artwork inside the canvas. Light and dark previews help you see pale edges and transparency. Some files include transparent margins, so a large canvas does not always mean a large visible subject.</p>
<h2>Learning with examples</h2>
<p>The <a href="/blog/">guides</a> cover layout exercises, image formats and export troubleshooting. Their diagrams are illustrative examples, with measurements you can adapt. Read the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for how writing tools, sources and corrections are handled.</p>
<h2>Permissions</h2>
<p>Downloads are offered for personal projects under the <a href="/license/">asset licence</a>. Do not resell or redistribute the files as a library. Ask before using an asset in client work, merchandise or a business promotion. A download does not grant rights in third-party brands or any additional material you use.</p>
<h2>Privacy and contact</h2>
<p>The composition tools render in your browser. Optional analytics and hosting logs are described in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>. You can decline analytics and still use the tools.</p>
<p>For corrections, asset requests, licensing enquiries or rights concerns, contact Sarath at <a href="mailto:hello@88cutouts.com">hello@88cutouts.com</a>. The <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> explains what information helps resolve a report.</p></article></div>
